      "canonicalConceptId": "concept:27f29791e53af3db24d4d815e2067b70e5c30359da91792627a7ff5703e47d70",
      "text": "For case alert delivery outside Salesforce, Event Relay supplies a managed forwarding path to Amazon EventBridge. Kafka connectors supply another integration path, including Confluent\u2019s managed connector and an OSO open-source candidate. Relay recovery options, pause versus stop behavior, and queryable error state affect whether downstream alert processing receives missed events. Broker selection therefore requires explicit recovery and monitoring choices; a connector\u2019s existence or vendor reliability claim does not prove lossless alert delivery.",
